[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2;44r\u001b[2;44r\u001b[1;103s\u001b[44;103H\n\u001b[2;44r\u001b[s\u001b[43;1H  \u001b[37mIn the first incident a pod killed itself. In this one every replica leaves the load balancer at\u001b[39m\u001b[44;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[1;44r\u001b[44;1H\u001b[?2026l\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2;44r\u001b[2;44r\u001b[1;103s\u001b[44;103H\n\u001b[2;44r\u001b[s\u001b[43;1H  \u001b[37monce, and the autoscalers try to help.\u001b[39m\u001b[44;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[1;44r\u001b[44;1H\u001b[?2026l"]
